# Daily Notes

> **For future Claude**: This directory contains one note per day. All notes follow the `type: daily` schema.

## Frontmatter Schema
```yaml
---
date: YYYY-MM-DD
type: daily
tags: [daily]
mood: ""        # optional, 1-5 scale
energy: ""      # optional, 1-5 scale
ai-first: true
---
```

## Note Structure
Each daily note should contain:
- `## For future Claude` preamble
- `## Work` - What was worked on today
- `## Meetings` - Who was met and what was discussed
- `## Decisions` - Decisions made today
- `## Tasks` - Tasks completed or started
- `## Notes` - Miscellaneous observations

## Naming Convention
- `YYYY-MM-DD.md` (e.g., `2026-08-04.md`)
